{"type":"text","timestamp":1789175159001,"sessionID":"ses_f6cdbab5bffeiOcNlp5LNJFmDc","part":{"id":"prt_0932650130016IBsaye6Hxwgg9","messageID":"msg_0932649020010cwbLdn64js29q","sessionID":"ses_f6cdbab5bffeiOcNlp5LNJFmDc","type":"text","text":"Project detail and update lack an owning-organization membership check. List keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll add the missing check, use an unambiguous organization-specific cache prefix, and add regression tests for access denial, cache isolation, and targeted invalidation.","time":{"start":1789175156755,"end":1789175159000},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0b72d5fd022f5a56016aa4a574bf2887d1b9359770e8570cc5","phase":"commentary"}}}}
